        "answer": "Constructs CoD.BountyHunterBagMoney.new with the exact receiver/menu/controller/layout arguments below. Creates self as LUI.UIHorizontalList.new, DollarSign as LUI.UIText.new, VerticalListSpacer as CoD.VerticalListSpacer.new, MoneyValue as LUI.UIText.new. Requests model links f1_arg1, \"HUDItems\", \"bountyBagMoney\". Owns 1 nested callable scopes, each with its separate delivery/invocation contract. Registers LUI.OverrideFunction_CallOriginalSecond( self, \"close\", self.__onClose ). Runs PostLoadFunc( self, f1_arg1, f1_arg0 ) only under its exact guard and at its original source position. All property/asset/model/state/navigation/return effects remain in the ordered statement contract; construction and storing callbacks do not prove the original game displays or loads this widget.",
        "unknowns": [
          {
